#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:462
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"YE BE IN NEED OF A VEHICKLE VESSEL? YARGH. I CAN OFFER YE ONE, IF YE HAVE "
"THE FUNDS!"
msgstr "탈것 선박이 필요한가? 야르. 하나 줄 수 있지, 돈만 있다면!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The captain offers to take "
msgstr "선장이 제안한다. 받는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:463
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " food "
msgstr " 식량. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"in exchange for giving you a (random) vehicle. You will keep your weapons "
"and loot."
msgstr "그 대가로 (무작위) 차량 한 대를 준다. 무기와 물자는 그대로 유지된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:466
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The group can't spare the food!"
msgstr "일행은 식량을 줄 여유가 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:469
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Reject offer"
msgstr "제안을 거절한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:471
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Accept offer"
msgstr "제안을 받아들인다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:474
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"YARGH, WHY NOT. TIS A FINE LAND VESSEL YE POSSESS. I'LL TRADE YOU FOOD FOR "
"IT."
msgstr "야르, 안 될 거 없지. 훌륭한 육지 선박을 가졌구먼. 식량이랑 바꿔 주지."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The captain offers "
msgstr "선장이 제안한다. 주는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "in exchange for your vehicle. You will keep your weapons and loot."
msgstr "그 대가로 너희 차량을 받는다. 무기와 물자는 그대로 유지된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:484
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE U.S.S RUSTOLEUM"
msgstr "U.S.S 녹슨호"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:486
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is exploring near the coast when they meet a skeleton captain of an old, "
"withered submarine that sunk nearby! The apocalypse brought him out of his "
"home."
msgstr "은(는) 해안 근처를 탐색하다 근처에 가라앉은 낡고 시든 잠수함의 해골 선장을 만난다! 종말 덕분에 그가 집 밖으로 나왔다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:487
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HI THERE. I'M NOT EVIL. PINKIE PROMISE!"
msgstr "안녕. 난 나쁜 놈 아니야. 새끼손가락 걸고 약속!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:488
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "His boney pinkie then falls off."
msgstr "그러자 그의 앙상한 새끼손가락이 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:489
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "What was the topic of their discussion?"
msgstr "무슨 이야기를 나눴을까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Your loot, please!"
msgstr ": 물건 좀 내놓으시지!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:493
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": WANNA FIGHT?"
msgstr ": 한판 붙을래?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:496
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:893
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": TELL HIM TO COOL IT"
msgstr ": 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Trade with him"
msgstr "그와 거래한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": D*VY JONES LOCKER"
msgstr ": D*VY 존스의 사물함"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:504
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": How'd you sink?"
msgstr ": 어쩌다 가라앉았어?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:509
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:527
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " plays "
msgstr "은(는) 해 본다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE STRONGMANN GAME! "
msgstr "스트롱맨 게임! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"It's one of those old games where you smash a button with a hammer to see "
"how SWOLE you are."
msgstr "망치로 버튼을 내리쳐서 얼마나 우람한지 재는 옛날 게임이다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:512
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:516
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DING DING DING DING DING"
msgstr "딩 딩 딩 딩 딩"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:513
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "YOU'RE A REAL SWOLE MOLE!"
msgstr "넌 진짜 근육 두더지야!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:517
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "FINAL VERDICT: MID-MUSCLE"
msgstr "최종 판정: 중간 근육"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:520
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:534
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "These carnival games are really getting out of hand."
msgstr "이 카니발 게임들 진짜 도가 지나치네."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Smashing that button repeatedly was great exercise! "
msgstr "버튼을 계속 내리친 게 훌륭한 운동이 됐다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:521
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " feels so much stronger already!"
msgstr "은(는) 벌써 훨씬 강해진 기분이다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE CLAY BIRD SHOOTING GAME! "
msgstr "클레이 사격 게임! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:527
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "There's a clay disk launcher and an intact double-barrel shotgun."
msgstr "클레이 원반 발사기와 멀쩡한 쌍열 산탄총이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:528
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds some ammo and takes the shotgun for themselves."
msgstr "은(는) 탄약을 좀 찾고 산탄총을 챙긴다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:532
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BANG BANG BANG!"
msgstr "탕 탕 탕!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:533
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "WOW, NICE SHOT, YA DINGUS!"
msgstr "와, 잘 쐈다, 이 멍청아!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" missed nearly every disk except the last! The launcher machine dispenses a "
"singular can of beans."
msgstr "은(는) 마지막 하나 빼고 원반을 거의 다 놓쳤다! 발사기가 콩 통조림 하나를 내놓는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" missed every single shot and almost fell over in the process! At least it "
"was good shooting practice."
msgstr "은(는) 한 발도 못 맞히고 넘어질 뻔했다! 그래도 사격 연습은 됐다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:544
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "That was a tough challenge! "
msgstr "어려운 도전이었다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:544
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is already a better shot as a result."
msgstr "은(는) 덕분에 벌써 사격 실력이 늘었다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE DODGEMS SMASHING GAME! "
msgstr "범퍼카 박치기 게임! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "There's a series of dinky iittle dodgem cars left to rot."
msgstr "썩어 가는 조그만 범퍼카들이 줄지어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds some gas and a wrench in the backrooms of the dodgems circuit."
msgstr "은(는) 범퍼카장 뒷방에서 기름과 렌치를 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:555
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BOUNCE BOUNCE BOUNCE BOUNCE CRAAASSSSSSH!"
msgstr "쿵 쿵 쿵 쿵 쾅앙아아앙!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:556
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "AMAZING! YOU DRIVE LIKE A DRUNKEN SQUIRREL!"
msgstr "놀라워! 술 취한 다람쥐처럼 운전하네!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" bashes around on the dodgems for a while. They even manage to avoid "
"breaking any bones!"
msgstr "은(는) 범퍼카로 한동안 이리저리 부딪친다. 뼈 하나 안 부러뜨리고 해냈다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" crashes into a wall at high speed halfway through! Something cracks in "
"their back. Youch!"
msgstr "은(는) 중간에 엄청난 속도로 벽에 부딪힌다! 허리에서 뭔가 우두둑한다. 아야!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Driving around with some janky controls is difficult, but "
msgstr "조작이 엉망인 차를 몰기는 어렵지만, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gains a slightly better understanding of machines as a result."
msgstr "은(는) 덕분에 기계를 조금 더 이해하게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " jumps on "
msgstr "은(는) 올라탄다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE GIANT HAMPSTER WHEEL! "
msgstr "거대 햄스터 쳇바퀴! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "There's a bunch of wires attached that seem to lead everywhere."
msgstr "사방으로 이어진 전선이 잔뜩 달려 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:573
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds a leather whip nearby. Whatever was this used for?"
msgstr "은(는) 근처에서 가죽 채찍을 찾는다. 대체 어디에 쓰던 거지?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "WHIRRRRR WHIRRRRR WHIRRRRRRRRRRR!"
msgstr "위이이잉 위이이잉 위이이이이이잉!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:577
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The rest of the carnival briefly illuminates! The wheel is a generator!"
msgstr "카니발의 나머지가 잠깐 불이 들어온다! 쳇바퀴가 발전기였다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The lights look amazing!"
msgstr "조명이 끝내준다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " runs like the wind! The wheel turns at blistering speeds!"
msgstr "은(는) 바람처럼 달린다! 쳇바퀴가 맹렬한 속도로 돈다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:585
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" loses their balance and slips off the wheel. They pull something in their "
"leg!"
msgstr "은(는) 균형을 잃고 쳇바퀴에서 미끄러진다. 다리를 삐끗했다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "All that running was great exercise! "
msgstr "그렇게 달린 게 훌륭한 운동이 됐다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " feels their glutes stregthen."
msgstr "은(는) 엉덩이 근육이 단단해지는 걸 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:595
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DARK CARNIVAL"
msgstr "어둠의 카니발"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:596
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" arrives at an old forgotten carnival grounds. Amidst many empty stalls, "
"some barely functional games remain."
msgstr "은(는) 오래 잊힌 카니발 부지에 도착한다. 텅 빈 가판대 사이에 겨우 돌아가는 게임 몇 개가 남아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Although many of them were just well-disguised scams before the apocalypse, "
"there's nobody to stop them having fun now."
msgstr "종말 전엔 대부분 교묘한 사기였겠지만, 이제는 재미를 막을 사람이 아무도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "There's enough time to play a game. Which?"
msgstr "게임 하나 할 시간은 있다. 뭘 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Strongman Hammer!"
msgstr ": 스트롱맨 망치!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Clay Shooting!"
msgstr ": 클레이 사격!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Dodgems!"
msgstr ": 범퍼카!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Hampster Wheel!"
msgstr ": 햄스터 쳇바퀴!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Alone, "
msgstr "홀로, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" faces down the alley, weapons drawn. They glance between each bandit; the "
"bandits stare."
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 뽑아 들고 골목을 마주한다. 약탈자들을 하나하나 훑어본다. 약탈자들도 노려본다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits rush down the alleyway towards "
msgstr "약탈자들이 골목을 따라 돌진한다. 향하는 곳은 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " quickly aims at each!"
msgstr "은(는) 재빨리 하나씩 조준한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " blasts the approaching bandits easily! The rest"
msgstr "는 다가오는 약탈자들을 가볍게 쏴 날린다! 나머지는"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " flee in terror!"
msgstr " 겁에 질려 도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:611
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "ITS FLYYYYY MOON. No, wait that's not how it goes..."
msgstr "이것이 플라이 문... 아니, 잠깐, 그게 아닌데..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The group is able to get through unscathed!"
msgstr "일행은 무사히 지나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The plan is simple: charge down the alleyway at full speed, and take the "
"distracted bandits by surprise."
msgstr "계획은 간단하다. 골목을 전속력으로 돌진해 방심한 약탈자들을 기습한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" rushes down the alleyway, weapons ready! Combat ensues, but the group has "
"the upper hand!"
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 들고 골목을 돌진한다! 전투가 벌어지지만, 일행이 우세하다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" takes some hits. The fighting is intense! Perhaps the plan would've worked "
"better if they'd been more swole."
msgstr "은(는) 몇 대 맞는다. 치열한 싸움이다! 좀 더 우람했다면 계획이 잘 먹혔을지도."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits are beaten! They stood no chance against the team's strength!"
msgstr "약탈자들을 물리쳤다! 일행의 힘 앞에 상대가 안 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The rest of the bandits flee! Everybody makes it safely through the "
"remainder of the alleyway."
msgstr "나머지 약탈자들이 도망친다! 모두 골목의 나머지 구간을 무사히 통과한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Whilst most would fall victim to this bandit group, "
msgstr "대부분은 이 약탈자 무리에게 당하겠지만, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " understands this is one of the oldest tricks in the book."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 가장 오래된 수법 중 하나라는 걸 안다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:638
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" disguises themselves as a bandit, creating a hood with a nearby trash bag. "
"Casually, "
msgstr "은(는) 근처 쓰레기봉투로 두건을 만들어 약탈자로 변장한다. 태연하게, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:638
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " approaches the cultists."
msgstr "는 광신도들에게 다가간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:640
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HEY FELLOW CULTISTS. COME WITH ME. I FOUND SOME LOSERS TO ROB!"
msgstr "어이 동지들. 따라와. 털어먹을 루저들을 찾았어!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits believe the shoddy disguise! "
msgstr "약탈자들이 엉성한 변장에 속는다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:643
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " leads them right into their carefully planned trap!"
msgstr "은(는) 그들을 공들여 준비한 함정으로 이끈다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:646
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Whilst the bandits are distracted, "
msgstr "약탈자들이 정신 팔린 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:646
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " slips away!"
msgstr "는 슬쩍 빠져나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The group robs the cultists instead! Free loot! Revenge!"
msgstr "오히려 일행이 광신도들을 턴다! 공짜 물자! 복수다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:655
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The cultists are embarassed by their stupidity!"
msgstr "광신도들은 자기들의 멍청함에 창피해한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:660
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits see through the disguise almost immediately."
msgstr "약탈자들은 변장을 거의 즉시 꿰뚫어 본다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:661
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "They beat up "
msgstr "그들이 무기로 꽤 심하게 두들겨 팬다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:661
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " pretty bad with their weapons!"
msgstr "을(를)!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:667
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits finally disperse, allowing the group to traverse through."
msgstr "약탈자들이 마침내 흩어지고, 일행은 지나갈 수 있게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " tries to reason with the bandits. Surely pure "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들을 설득하려 한다. 분명 순수한 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "LOGIC AND REASON"
msgstr "논리와 이성"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " can dispel their bandit ways?"
msgstr "(으)로 약탈자 근성을 몰아낼 수 있지 않을까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits laugh at this zany attempt to disparage their "
msgstr "약탈자들이 이 엉뚱한 시도를 비웃는다. 감히 모욕하다니: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SACRED OBAMA, THE FORETOLD GREAT CREATOR!"
msgstr "신성한 오바마, 예언된 위대한 창조주를!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:687
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Then they rob the group for everything they're carrying."
msgstr "그러고는 일행이 가진 걸 몽땅 털어 간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:688
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:719
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "CHARACTER WEAPONS LOST!"
msgstr "캐릭터 무기 분실!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Having taken enough for themselves, the cultists let the group through."
msgstr "충분히 챙긴 광신도들이 일행을 지나가게 해 준다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:694
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"WE...WE WERE WRONG? ALL THIS TIME? THE GREAT CREATOR WAS NOT OBAMA AFTER "
"ALL?"
msgstr "우리가... 우리가 틀렸다고? 지금까지? 위대한 창조주가 오바마가 아니었다고?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:695
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"YEAH HE'S JUST THE PRESIDENT OR SOMETHING. I DON'T KNOW, I DIDN'T PASS "
"HISTORY."
msgstr "그래, 그냥 대통령인가 뭐 그런 사람이야. 몰라, 역사 낙제했거든."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:696
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits look at one another awkwardly. Obama...a mere president? They "
"believed a lie, all this time?"
msgstr "약탈자들이 어색하게 서로 쳐다본다. 오바마가... 그냥 대통령? 지금까지 거짓을 믿어 온 건가?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:697
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The group of bandits go their separate ways, clearing the way for the group "
"to pass through the alleyway. That was easy!"
msgstr "약탈자 무리가 뿔뿔이 흩어지며 골목길이 뚫린다. 쉬웠다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:707
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" try to sneak around the cultists. This means going the whole long way "
"around the edge of town, a lengthy and dangerous prospect."
msgstr "은(는) 광신도들을 피해 몰래 돌아가려 한다. 그러려면 마을 가장자리를 빙 둘러 가야 해서, 오래 걸리고 위험하다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:708
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Whilst trying to dodge the cultist patrols, they're forced to hide away in a"
" dilapidated house."
msgstr "광신도 순찰대를 피하다가, 일행은 다 쓰러져 가는 집에 숨어야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:712
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Everybody keeps calm! The bandits are successfully evaded. Nobody even so "
"much as squealed!"
msgstr "모두 침착하다! 약탈자들을 무사히 따돌렸다. 아무도 끽소리 하나 안 냈다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:713
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Still, knowing that imminent death might be around the corner is mildly "
"terrifying!"
msgstr "그래도 죽음이 바로 코앞에 있을지 모른다는 생각에 살짝 무섭다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is quickly discovered thanks to incessant "
msgstr "은(는) 끊임없는 이것 때문에 금방 들킨다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "shrieking and screaming!"
msgstr "비명과 고함!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:718
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Then bandits rob them for everything they're carrying."
msgstr "그러고는 약탈자들이 일행이 가진 걸 몽땅 털어 간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:724
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The team is eventually allowed to pass and escape."
msgstr "결국 일행은 지나가서 도망치는 게 허락된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:729
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"In the alleyway there's little cover for the fight. The fighting is brutal "
"on both sides."
msgstr "골목엔 엄폐물이 거의 없다. 양쪽 다 처절하게 싸운다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:730
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"After a protracted fight, the bandits flee down the alleyway. The path ahead is clear!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"한참 싸운 끝에, 약탈자들이 골목 아래로 도망친다. 길이 뚫렸다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:747
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "OOGA CHAKA OOGA CHAKA"
msgstr "우가 차카 우가 차카"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:748
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Whilst adventuring through a town, "
msgstr "마을을 모험하던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:748
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gets lost. The only way back is through a single, dark alleyway."
msgstr "은(는) 길을 잃는다. 돌아갈 유일한 길은 어둡고 좁은 골목 하나뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Down the alleyway, a group of "
msgstr "골목 아래쪽에서 한 무리의 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "hooded cult-like individuals "
msgstr "두건 쓴 광신도 같은 자들이 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "gather round burning drums, chanting some kind of horrible mantra."
msgstr "불타는 드럼통 주위에 모여 끔찍한 주문을 외고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Cultists are unreasonable, and will take everything if you let them."
msgstr "광신도들은 말이 안 통하고, 내버려 두면 전부 빼앗아 간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:751
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "There's no way out but through. Something MUST be done:"
msgstr "뚫고 가는 수밖에 없다. 뭔가 해야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:754
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": SHOWDOWN TIME"
msgstr ": 결투 시간"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:758
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Catch them off-guard!"
msgstr ": 방심한 틈을 노린다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": I know their tricks!"
msgstr ": 놈들 수법은 다 알아!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:765
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Fight the bandits"
msgstr "약탈자들과 싸운다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:767
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Reason with them"
msgstr ": 설득한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:769
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Try to sneak around"
msgstr "몰래 돌아간다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " stands before the mech, gazing up at it to study it for weaknesses. "
msgstr "은(는) 메카 앞에 서서 약점을 찾으려고 올려다본다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:786
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" quickly deduces that the 'mech' is actually just made of really compact "
"cardboard."
msgstr "은(는) 그 '메카'가 사실 아주 단단하게 뭉친 골판지라는 걸 금방 알아챈다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"They kick the mech in the shins, where the glue and joints are weakest!"
msgstr "그들은 접착제와 이음새가 가장 약한 메카의 정강이를 걷어찬다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:790
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The mech crumbles like a tower of blocks into rubble, followed by a loud "
"CRASH. "
msgstr "메카가 블록 탑처럼 무너져 잔해가 되고, 쾅 하는 소리가 뒤따른다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Under the watchful eye of the tinker-gungineer, NO sloppy works shall escape"
" punishment."
msgstr "땜장이 총기공의 감시 아래선 엉성한 작업은 절대 그냥 넘어가지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't know what to do next! The robot picks them up and launches them "
"into the ground. The group is forced to flee!"
msgstr "은(는) 다음에 뭘 해야 할지 모른다! 로봇이 그들을 집어 땅에 내리꽂는다. 일행은 도망칠 수밖에 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " awkwardly tries for several minutes to deduce a weakness."
msgstr "은(는) 몇 분 동안 어설프게 약점을 찾으려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The bandit mech becomes bored and kicks them at high velocity into a tree! "
msgstr "약탈자 메카가 지루해져서 그들을 엄청난 속도로 나무에 걷어차 버린다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:800
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:837
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is forced to flee!"
msgstr "은(는) 도망칠 수밖에 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:808
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " yells "
msgstr "은(는) 외친다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:808
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:979
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COOL IT!"
msgstr "진정해!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " farts at the mech. Somehow it understands."
msgstr "은(는) 메카에게 방귀를 뀐다. 어째선지 메카가 알아듣는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:814
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"COOL...COOL IT? HMMM. MAYBE YOU'RE RIGHT. I DO NEED BETTER COOLING "
"SYSTEMS...GREAT IDEA!"
msgstr "진정...진정하라고? 흠. 네 말이 맞을지도. 냉각 시스템을 개선해야겠어...좋은 생각이야!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:815
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The mech gives the group payment for their ingenious idea!"
msgstr "메카가 기발한 아이디어의 대가로 일행에게 보수를 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:823
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" and the robot hold a stare for several seconds before the mech starts "
"attacking everyone!"
msgstr "와(과) 로봇은 몇 초간 서로 노려보다가, 메카가 모두를 공격하기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:839
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The group would flee...if there was anybody left."
msgstr "일행은 도망쳤을 거다... 남은 사람이 있었다면."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:845
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" genuinely believed there was an enormous mech! You never know what's around"
" the corner in the zombocalypse. They quickly form a plan!"
msgstr "은(는) 정말로 거대한 메카가 있다고 믿었다! 좀비 종말엔 코앞에 뭐가 있을지 모르는 법. 재빨리 계획을 세운다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:846
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "EJECT! EJECT EJECT EJECT!"
msgstr "탈출! 탈출 탈출 탈출!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:847
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The robot makes a creaking, whirring noise. It can't tell the difference "
"between the bandit's voice and "
msgstr "로봇이 삐걱거리며 윙윙 소리를 낸다. 약탈자의 목소리와 구분하지 못한다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:847
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "! It ejects the bandit high into the atmosphere!"
msgstr "의 목소리를! 로봇이 약탈자를 대기권 높이 사출한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:848
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "CURSEEEE YOUUUUUU EJECTTTT BUTTONNNNNNNNNNNnnnnnnnn......"
msgstr "저주하리라아아아 탈출 버트으으으은......"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:856
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " draws their weapons and aims for the knees of the robot!"
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 뽑아 로봇의 무릎을 조준한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:857
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "They destroy the knees of the robot in a hail of bullet fury!"
msgstr "그들은 총알 세례로 로봇의 무릎을 박살 낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is too quick for the mech bandit! It wobbles back and forth dramatically, "
"before falling flat into a heap."
msgstr "은(는) 메카 약탈자보다 너무 빠르다! 메카가 극적으로 휘청거리다 앞으로 고꾸라진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:875
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1031
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " decides to play it safe. "
msgstr "은(는) 안전하게 가기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:875
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1031
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " give"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:875
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1031
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " into the bandits' demands."
msgstr " 약탈자들의 요구에 굴복한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:883
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "BANDFORMERS...BANDITS IN DISGUISE"
msgstr "밴드포머... 변장한 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:885
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is travelling steadily along a stretch of road when a bandit in some kind "
"of mech steps out from behind an apartment. Through a dry text-to-speech "
"voice, it speaks:"
msgstr "은(는) 길을 꾸준히 달리던 중, 메카 같은 걸 탄 약탈자가 아파트 뒤에서 걸어 나온다. 건조한 음성 합성 목소리로 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:886
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "ALL YOUR LOOT IS BELONG TO US."
msgstr "너희의 물자는 모두 우리의 것이 되었다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:887
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "This thing is so large it could probably crush your car with ease."
msgstr "이 녀석은 너무 커서 차쯤은 가볍게 뭉갤 수 있을 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:888
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The mech demands all of your gas and ammunition to pass."
msgstr "메카는 지나가려면 기름과 탄약을 전부 내놓으라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:890
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Dismantle it!"
msgstr ": 분해해 버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:897
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " thought a giant mech might be nearby"
msgstr "이(가) 거대 메카가 근처에 있을 줄 알았다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:901
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " blasts the mech's knees"
msgstr "이(가) 메카의 무릎을 날린다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:904
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Pay the toll"
msgstr "통행료를 낸다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:924
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " has no fear of cops. They reach into the pocket."
msgstr "은(는) 경찰 따위 무섭지 않다. 주머니에 손을 넣는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:927
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " pulls out a bomb and casually threatens the bandits with it!"
msgstr "은(는) 폭탄을 꺼내 태연하게 약탈자들을 협박한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:928
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "TAKE A LOOK AT THIS! IT'S US OR YOU, NERDS! YOUR CHOICE!"
msgstr "이거 봐라! 우리 아니면 너희다, 찐따들아! 골라!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:929
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:933
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits reluctantly agree to let "
msgstr "약탈자들은 마지못해 지나가게 해 준다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:929
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:933
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " pass so they aren't blown to smithereens."
msgstr ". 산산조각 나기는 싫으니까."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:931
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't actually own anything pocket-sized and explosive enough, so is "
"forced to pretend."
msgstr "은(는) 사실 주머니에 들어갈 만한 폭발물이 없어서, 있는 척할 수밖에 없다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Luckily, "
msgstr "다행히, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is an amazing liar. "
msgstr "은(는) 엄청난 거짓말쟁이다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:932
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " successfully fools the bandits with a bottle of juice!"
msgstr "는 주스 한 병으로 약탈자들을 속이는 데 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:938
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " sets fire to the police station anyway."
msgstr "은(는) 어쨌든 경찰서에 불을 지른다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:945
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " knew this would go awry and so prepared a plan in advance."
msgstr "은(는) 일이 꼬일 줄 알고 미리 계획을 세워 뒀다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:946
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" crashes through the walls of the police station with their car! Rubble "
"flies everywhere! The car takes some damage."
msgstr "은(는) 차로 경찰서 벽을 뚫고 들어간다! 잔해가 사방으로 날린다! 차가 좀 손상된다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:948
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits are terrified and begin to flee! "
msgstr "도적들은 겁에 질려 달아나기 시작한다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:948
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gets to pass for free!"
msgstr "은(는) 공짜로 지나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:953
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " insists that they were a cop too, just like they are!"
msgstr "은(는) 자기도 저들처럼 경찰이었다고 우긴다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:954
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "OH YEAH? PROVE IT THEN."
msgstr "오 그래? 그럼 증명해 봐."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:957
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" remembers reading a police training manual years ago. They shoot a couple "
"of cans and accurately recite some of the manual!"
msgstr "은(는) 몇 년 전에 읽은 경찰 훈련 교본을 떠올린다. 깡통 몇 개를 쏴 맞히고 교본 내용을 정확히 읊는다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:958
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SO YOU'RE A REAL HOTSHOT COP EH? GOOD ENOUGH. YOU CAN GO."
msgstr "진짜 날고 기는 경찰이시구만? 됐어. 가도 좋아."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:959
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " can't believe that actually worked!"
msgstr "은(는) 그게 진짜 먹혔다는 게 믿기지 않는다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:960
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:966
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits let the group go without fuss!"
msgstr "도적들은 순순히 일행을 보내 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:963
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"They don't actually know much about policing, and instead parrot random "
"things from old TV shows."
msgstr "사실 치안에 대해 아는 게 별로 없어서, 옛날 TV 드라마 대사를 아무거나 따라 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:964
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"YEAH SO IT'S REALLY IMPORTANT TO TURN THE SIRENS ON ALL THE TIME AND SAY "
"'OVER' REPEATEDLY. OVER."
msgstr "그러니까 사이렌은 항상 켜 두고 '오버'라고 계속 말하는 게 진짜 중요해. 오버."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:965
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The cops pause and look at one another for a moment. Close enough!"
msgstr "경찰들은 잠시 멈추고 서로를 바라본다. 그럴듯하네!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:968
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Splurts random lines from old cop films that sound cool to say."
msgstr "옛날 형사 영화에서 멋있어 보이는 대사를 아무렇게나 내뱉는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:969
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "ARE YOU FEELING PLUCKY...DINK?"
msgstr "오늘 운이 좋다고 생각하나...찐따?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:970
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The cop bandits look confused at one another momentarily and then start "
"blasting! The group is caught in a bad spot!"
msgstr "경찰 도적들은 잠깐 어리둥절하게 서로를 보더니 총을 쏘기 시작한다! 일행은 곤란한 처지에 빠진다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:979
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " screams "
msgstr "은(는) 외친다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:979
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " at the top of "
msgstr " ("

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:979
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " lungs."
msgstr " 목청을 다해)"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:981
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" lets rip an enormous, almost nuclear fart in the cop's general direction."
msgstr "은(는) 경찰 쪽을 향해 거의 핵폭탄급의 엄청난 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:984
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"OH, YOU MUST BE THE NEW CAPTAIN! WE DIDN'T RECOGNISE YOU. HERE, TAKE THIS!"
msgstr "오, 새로 오신 서장님이시군요! 몰라봬서 죄송합니다. 여기, 이거 받으세요!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:985
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits deem that "
msgstr "도적들은 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:985
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " will be their new captain! They hand over many weapons!"
msgstr "을(를) 새 서장으로 모시기로 한다! 무기를 잔뜩 넘겨준다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:990
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "CHROME SHOTGUN GET! MACHINEPISTOL GET!"
msgstr "크롬 샷건 획득! 기관권총 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:995
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The cops mistake this for some kind of super secret criminal dialect! This "
"must be the most wanted criminal in history! They start blasting "
msgstr "경찰들은 이걸 무슨 극비 범죄자 은어로 착각한다! 역사상 최악의 현상수배범이 분명하다! 그들은 곧바로 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:995
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " straight away!"
msgstr "에게 총을 쏘기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1002
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " draws "
msgstr "은(는) 번개 같은 속도로 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1002
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " firearms at blistering speed, trapping everybody in..."
msgstr " 총을 뽑아, 모두를 가둬 버린다..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1003
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THE GREAT (ONLY VAGUELY) MEXICAN SORT-OF-SITTING-ACTUALLY STANDOFF"
msgstr "위대한 (어렴풋이) 멕시칸 거의-앉은-사실은-선 대치"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1004
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "For several hours, "
msgstr "몇 시간 동안, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1004
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " and the bandits point guns at one another awkwardly with some noises."
msgstr "와(과) 도적들은 어색하게 소리를 내며 서로 총을 겨눈다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1008
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is so patient that the bandits become bored and retreat! "
msgstr "은(는) 너무나 참을성이 강해서 도적들이 지루해져 물러난다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1008
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " passes the cop bandits for free!"
msgstr "은(는) 경찰 도적들을 공짜로 지나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1014
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " becomes bored and starts blasting! A fight ensues, but "
msgstr "은(는) 지루해져서 총을 쏘기 시작한다! 싸움이 벌어지지만, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1014
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " has the advantage!"
msgstr "이(가) 유리하다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1042
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "DIRTY HAROLD 8: SHOOTING MORE CRIMINALS AGAIN"
msgstr "더티 해럴드 8: 범죄자를 또 쏴 버리다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1044
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" comes across what seems to be a police station. As soon as they enter, cop "
"bandits encircle them!"
msgstr "은(는) 경찰서처럼 보이는 곳을 발견한다. 들어서자마자 경찰 도적들이 둘러싼다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1045
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"They're all in shoddy stolen uniforms, positioned behind overturned tables "
"with their revolvers ready."
msgstr "모두 허름한 훔친 제복 차림으로, 뒤집힌 탁자 뒤에서 리볼버를 겨누고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1046
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandit cops demand all your spare weapons and ammunition."
msgstr "경찰 도적들이 남는 무기와 탄약을 전부 내놓으라고 요구한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1049
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " has a surprise..."
msgstr "에게 비장의 수가 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1053
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " knew there would be trouble!"
msgstr "은(는) 문제가 생길 줄 알았다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1057
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " screams COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 진정하라고 외친다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1061
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is DEFINITELY a cop!"
msgstr "은(는) 확실히 경찰이다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1065
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": MEXICAN STANDOFF"
msgstr ": 멕시칸 대치"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1068
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Give up ammo and weapons"
msgstr "탄약과 무기를 내놓는다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is always prepared for a fire! They brought an improvised fire extinguisher"
" with them the moment they saw burnt buildings."
msgstr "은(는) 언제나 화재에 대비하고 있다! 불탄 건물들을 보자마자 급조한 소화기를 챙겨 왔다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits weapons are extinguished! "
msgstr "도적들의 무기가 꺼졌다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " looks pleased. Somebody could've gotten SERIOUSLY hurt."
msgstr "은(는) 흡족해한다. 누군가 심하게 다칠 뻔했다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" extinguished their special campfire! The bandits attack, but at a "
"disadvantage."
msgstr "이(가) 그들의 특별한 모닥불을 꺼 버렸다! 도적들이 공격하지만, 불리한 상태다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " recognises the bandits as fellow pyromaniacs!"
msgstr "은(는) 도적들이 같은 방화광이라는 걸 알아본다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " and the bandits get lost in a conversation about"
msgstr "와(과) 도적들은 대화에 푹 빠진다. 주제는"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " arson, fire safety, and the advantages of kerosene as fuel."
msgstr " 방화, 화재 안전, 그리고 연료로서 등유의 장점."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"In the midst of this conversation, the bandits completely forget about "
"robbing! They give everyone an honorary molotov."
msgstr "대화 도중 도적들은 강도질을 까맣게 잊는다! 모두에게 명예 화염병을 하나씩 준다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MOLOTOV GET!"
msgstr "화염병 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Out of nowhere, "
msgstr "난데없이, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " runs up to a bandit and hurls him away like a bowling ball!"
msgstr "이(가) 도적 하나에게 달려가 볼링공처럼 집어던진다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Then, as the bandits are still in shock, "
msgstr "도적들이 아직 충격에 빠진 사이, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " picks up another bandit and slams them down onto their back!"
msgstr "는 다른 도적을 들어 올려 등부터 메다꽂는다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits are terrified! They back away slowly from the carnage. "
msgstr "도적들은 겁에 질렸다! 참상에서 천천히 물러난다. "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" produces something from their pocket, a vaguely shiny deep red pepper."
msgstr "은(는) 주머니에서 뭔가를 꺼낸다. 은은하게 빛나는 짙은 빨간 고추다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "YOU WANNA SEE FIRE? CHECK THIS OUT."
msgstr "불 보고 싶어? 이거 봐."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " swallows the ENTIRE "
msgstr "은(는) 통째로 삼킨다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "GASTGANO DELUXE ULTRA CALIFORNIA REAPER!"
msgstr "가스트가노 디럭스 울트라 캘리포니아 리퍼!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " They breathe fire in a rehearsed display!"
msgstr " 연습한 듯 불을 뿜는다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits are extremely impressed! "
msgstr "도적들은 엄청나게 감탄한다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " however is upset to have used their special chilli."
msgstr "은(는) 특별한 고추를 써 버려서 속상해한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" makes a high pitched squeal, almost too high pitched to hear. The bandits "
"process this."
msgstr "은(는) 들릴락 말락 한 높은 소리로 끽 하고 소리친다. 도적들이 그 뜻을 곱씹는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "COOL IT? I SUPPOSE YOU'RE RIGHT...WE'VE RUINED SO MUCH OF THIS TOWN."
msgstr "진정하라고? 네 말이 맞는 것 같아...우리가 이 마을을 너무 많이 망쳤어."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits feel guilty for their trail of destruction! They resolve to make"
" things right!"
msgstr "도적들은 자신들이 남긴 파괴의 흔적에 죄책감을 느낀다! 잘못을 바로잡기로 다짐한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"This message is highly antithetical to the bandit's philosophy! They torch "
msgstr "이 말은 도적들의 철학에 정면으로 반한다! 그들은 복수로 "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " in revenge!"
msgstr "에게 불을 지른다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "THROUGH THE FIRE AND FLAMES"
msgstr "불길을 뚫고"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "When exploring a burnt down town, "
msgstr "불타 버린 마을을 탐색하던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is ambushed by a group of bandits!"
msgstr "은(는) 도적 무리에게 매복당한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"They're all wielding lit flamethrowers, torches, and tiny little cigarette "
"lighters. One of them is quite literally just on fire."
msgstr "모두 불붙은 화염방사기, 횃불, 조그만 라이터를 들고 있다. 그중 하나는 말 그대로 그냥 불타고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The bandits demand all your gas and spare weapons!"
msgstr "도적들이 기름과 남는 무기를 전부 내놓으라고 요구한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is always prepared for a fire!"
msgstr "은(는) 언제나 화재에 대비하고 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Greet your fellow pyromaniacs"
msgstr "동료 방화광들에게 인사한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": SUPLEX!"
msgstr ": 수플렉스!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": JALAPENO BONANZA"
msgstr ": 할라피뇨 대박"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": COOL IT"
msgstr ": 진정해"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Give up gas and weapons"
msgstr "기름과 무기를 내놓는다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "METAL CHAINS"
msgstr "쇠사슬"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "LEATHER WHIP"
msgstr "가죽 채찍"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "CLEAVER"
msgstr "식칼"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "PISTOL"
msgstr "권총"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1288
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "REVOLVER"
msgstr "리볼버"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SHOTGUN"
msgstr "샷건"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "CHROME SHOTGUN"
msgstr "크롬 샷건"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "HUNTING RIFLE"
msgstr "사냥총"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MACHINEPISTOL"
msgstr "기관권총"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SOME WOOD"
msgstr "나무 조금"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "EMPTY BRANDY BOTTLE"
msgstr "빈 브랜디 병"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "SOME REBAR"
msgstr "철근 조금"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "1 PIPEBOMB"
msgstr "파이프 폭탄 1개"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "LOO ROLL"
msgstr "휴지"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "METAL PIPE"
msgstr "쇠파이프"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "TIRE IRON"
msgstr "타이어 렌치"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " inserts "
msgstr "은(는) 넣는다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "8 food"
msgstr "식량 8"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " into the specially designed receptacle."
msgstr "을(를) 특수 설계된 투입구에."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The weapon makes a variety of loud churning noises, emits sparks everywhere "
"and stops suddenly."
msgstr "무기에서 온갖 시끄러운 덜컹 소리가 나고, 사방에 불꽃이 튀더니 갑자기 멈춘다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "A panel opens and a weapon flies out!"
msgstr "패널이 열리고 무기가 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1316
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1332
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1345
#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " GET!"
msgstr " 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " pokes around the food insertion hole with a stick for a little while."
msgstr "은(는) 한동안 막대기로 식량 투입구를 쑤셔 본다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"The first rule of mystery box design: never leave open ports! The second "
"rule is classified. Every engineer knows that!"
msgstr "미스터리 박스 설계의 제1원칙: 포트를 절대 열어 두지 말 것! 제2원칙은 기밀이다. 엔지니어라면 다 안다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "After some fiddling, the box comes undone naturally!"
msgstr "좀 만지작거리니, 상자가 자연스럽게 열린다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " even manages to force the food deposit reservoir open!"
msgstr "은(는) 식량 저장고까지 억지로 열어 낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't know much about hacking, but manages to scrape together enough "
"knowledge to try."
msgstr "은(는) 해킹에 대해 잘 모르지만, 시도해 볼 만큼의 지식은 그럭저럭 긁어모은다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1342
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"They spend hours trying various methods. Poking the screen, shrieking, and "
"bashing it with a wrench."
msgstr "몇 시간 동안 갖은 방법을 시도한다. 화면 찌르기, 비명 지르기, 렌치로 두들기기."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "MEGA GIGA XL LOCKCORP DELUXESAFE MYSTERY BOX"
msgstr "메가 기가 XL 락코프 디럭스세이프 미스터리 박스"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is almost impervious, but "
msgstr "은(는) 거의 난공불락이지만, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1343
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " eventually brute-forces the password."
msgstr "이(가) 결국 비밀번호를 무차별 대입으로 뚫는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't stand a chance against the mystery box's numerous anti-tampering "
"measures!"
msgstr "은(는) 미스터리 박스의 수많은 변조 방지 장치를 당해낼 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1353
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "ALERT. TAMPER DETECTED. ALERT. TAMPER DETECTED."
msgstr "경고. 변조 감지. 경고. 변조 감지."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The box's alarms cause zombies to begin to approach the store! "
msgstr "상자의 경보 때문에 좀비들이 가게로 몰려오기 시작한다! "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1354
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is forced to leave!"
msgstr "은(는) 떠날 수밖에 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Now they'll never know what was in the box!"
msgstr "이제 상자 안에 뭐가 있었는지 영영 알 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " has seen this plenty of times before. After a brief look around, "
msgstr "은(는) 이런 걸 숱하게 봐 왔다. 잠깐 둘러보더니, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds the master override key in a manager's office!"
msgstr "는 점장 사무실에서 마스터 해제 키를 찾아낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " inserts the key. A panel opens and a weapon flies out!"
msgstr "이(가) 키를 꽂는다. 패널이 열리고 무기가 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "The rapidly opening panels bash "
msgstr "급하게 열린 패널이 때린다: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"'s knuckles! CLEARLY this was never made OSHA compliant. The apocalypse is "
"no excuse to slack on safety!"
msgstr "의 손가락 마디를! 이건 분명 산업안전 기준을 지켜 만든 물건이 아니다. 종말이 왔다고 안전을 소홀히 해도 되는 건 아니다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "...WONDER WHO IT'S FROM?"
msgstr "...누가 보낸 걸까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "In the middle of an abandoned store, "
msgstr "버려진 가게 한가운데서, "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " comes across a huge metal box."
msgstr "은(는) 거대한 금속 상자를 발견한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
"Bolted down. Metal exterior. Official DINKSCO branding. Locks and switches "
"galore, the full package. With any luck, this thing could probably survive "
"an atomic bomb."
msgstr ""
"볼트로 고정됨. 금속 외장. 공식 딩크스코 로고. 자물쇠와 스위치가 잔뜩, 풀옵션이다. 운이 좋으면 원자폭탄도 버틸 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1390
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "It seems to have some kind of food insertion system."
msgstr "무슨 식량 투입 장치 같은 게 달려 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "PRICE: 8 FOOD || WEAPON: PROBABLY"
msgstr "가격: 식량 8 || 무기: 아마도"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid "Deposit food - 8 food"
msgstr "식량 투입 - 식량 8"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1397
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ": Reverse engineer it open!"
msgstr ": 역설계해서 연다!"

