#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:873
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid ""
"The train glides ungracefully to a halt, like some sort of mechanical "
"screeching bat."
msgstr "열차가 무슨 끼익대는 기계 박쥐처럼 볼품없이 미끄러지며 멈춘다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:874
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid ""
"Once the train stops, the survivors of the train assault have the "
"opportunity to explore some new locations."
msgstr "열차가 멈추면, 열차 습격의 생존자들은 새로운 장소들을 탐험할 기회를 얻는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "Alligators On A Train"
msgstr "열차 위의 악어들"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:881
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid ""
"This train has been going for a while. Maybe if you pull the stop lever, "
"you'll end up somewhere new."
msgstr "이 열차는 한참을 달려왔다. 정지 레버를 당기면 어딘가 새로운 곳에 도착할지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:882
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid ""
"The longer you wait, the better the locations you find will be. The "
"locations are about 15m apart."
msgstr "오래 기다릴수록 더 좋은 장소를 찾게 된다. 장소는 약 15분 간격이다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:883
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "You've held out for: "
msgstr "버틴 시간: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:883
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "m"
msgstr "분"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:884
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "Found locations will be... "
msgstr "찾을 장소: "

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:886
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "Keep fighting!"
msgstr "계속 싸운다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:887
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "Pull the STOP! lever"
msgstr "정지! 레버를 당긴다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/train.df:1261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/train.df"
msgid "HOLDOUT!"
msgstr "버텨라!"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid "I hope you enjoy the new character! Be sure to give us feedback."
msgstr "새 캐릭터를 즐겨 주세요! 꼭 피드백 부탁드립니다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:22 deathforth/events/testregion.df:32
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:42 deathforth/events/testregion.df:52
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid "NEWEST CHARS"
msgstr "최신 캐릭터"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:24 deathforth/events/testregion.df:34
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"Try out the new character for free! You can find them here, but in the new "
"update, they'll be found in camps instead."
msgstr "새 캐릭터를 무료로 써 보세요! 지금은 여기서 만날 수 있지만, 새 업데이트에서는 캠프에서 만나게 됩니다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"First Mate can leap with the SWAP button, 6s cooldown! Attack while midair "
"for serious AoE damage! Also: anchor."
msgstr "일등항해사는 교체 버튼으로 도약할 수 있습니다(쿨다운 6초)! 공중에서 공격하면 강력한 범위 피해! 그리고: 닻."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:27 deathforth/events/testregion.df:37
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:47 deathforth/events/testregion.df:57
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid "Leave them for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:28 deathforth/events/testregion.df:38
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:48 deathforth/events/testregion.df:58
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid "Hire them"
msgstr "고용한다"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character can protect your teammates and has a strong knockdown-execute"
" halberd combo. Thrust to knockdown, then slash to instakill."
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 동료를 보호할 수 있고, 강력한 넘어뜨리기-처형 미늘창 콤보가 있습니다. 찌르기로 넘어뜨리고, 베기로 즉사시키세요."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character is really good at modifying the car! Use less fuel AND travel"
" faster!"
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 차 개조에 아주 능합니다! 연료는 덜 쓰고 더 빨리 달립니다!"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:54 deathforth/events/testregion.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"Try out the new character for free! You can find them here, but in the new "
"update, they'll be on the road instead."
msgstr "새 캐릭터를 무료로 써 보세요! 지금은 여기서 만날 수 있지만, 새 업데이트에서는 길에서 만나게 됩니다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character can multishot with any firearm! Their melee attacks also "
"kneecap enemies. Steal food and people's knees!"
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 어떤 총기로든 다중 사격이 가능합니다! 근접 공격은 적의 무릎도 박살 냅니다. 음식과 사람들의 무릎을 훔치세요!"

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"IDK if I'll keep this char. They're mainly a ragdoll physics experiment; "
"they explode ragdoll-style when bitten."
msgstr "이 캐릭터를 유지할지는 모르겠어요. 주로 래그돌 물리 실험용이라, 물리면 래그돌처럼 폭발합니다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" slams a smoke bomb into the ground!\r\n"
"\tShe's gone!"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 연막탄을 땅에 내리꽂는다!\r\n"
"\t사라졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" takes the food and then slams a smoke bomb into the ground. She's gone!\r\n"
"\tNo wait, she's following you now."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 식량을 받더니 연막탄을 땅에 내리꽂는다. 사라졌다!\r\n"
"\t아니 잠깐, 이제 너희를 따라오고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"She likes her personal space for sword swinging, so you'll have to boot "
"someone."
msgstr "칼을 휘두를 개인 공간이 필요하다니, 누군가를 내보내야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Ninja Strike 3: Third Strike"
msgstr "닌자 스트라이크 3: 서드 스트라이크"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" finds someone dressed in a ninja costume, standing in camp with a dramatic "
"crossing-arms pose. Her impractical-length headband waves in the wind."
msgstr "은(는) 닌자 복장을 하고 캠프에서 극적으로 팔짱을 낀 채 서 있는 사람을 발견한다. 쓸데없이 긴 머리띠가 바람에 나부낀다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave her be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Approach her"
msgstr "다가간다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Bribe her to join for 5 food"
msgstr "식량 5로 매수해 합류시킨다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" notices that the team is already full.\r\n"
"\t\tYou'll have to boot someone out of the team to make room. You should, since you already gave up the food."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 팀이 이미 꽉 찼다는 걸 알아챈다.\r\n"
"\t\t자리를 만들려면 누군가를 내보내야 한다. 이미 식량을 줬으니 그러는 게 좋겠다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " joins the team! He outright refuses to let go of "
msgstr "이(가) 팀에 합류한다! 그는 절대 놓지 않겠다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "BERTHA"
msgstr "버사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ", and says no one will ever be able to pry it from him."
msgstr ". 누구도 자기한테서 떼어 낼 수 없다고 말한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "RAMBEUX: FIRST BUTT"
msgstr "램보: 퍼스트 엉덩이"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" meets a serious looking guy. He's holding a gigantic knife and he's "
"carrying a "
msgstr "은(는) 진지해 보이는 남자를 만난다. 거대한 칼을 들고, 등에는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "MINIGUN"
msgstr "미니건"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" across his back.\r\n"
"\tHe mumbles that he is a mercenary for hire, paid up front."
msgstr ""
"을(를) 메고 있다.\r\n"
"\t그는 선불로 고용되는 용병이라고 웅얼거린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:68
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:440
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:460
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:552
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:578
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave him for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Pay up front - 10 food"
msgstr "선불로 낸다 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "His price is 10 food, and you don't have enough."
msgstr "그의 몸값은 식량 10인데, 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:72
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:109
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:142
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:324
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:368
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:400
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:422
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:444
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:464
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:487
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:510
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:533
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:556
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:582
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:606
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Can't spare the food"
msgstr "식량을 내줄 여유가 없다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" seems disappointed by the amount of food you gave her, but only for the briefest moment.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 받은 식량 양에 실망한 듯하지만, 그것도 아주 잠깐이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Thanks for the cat food! Please pet the kitties! "
msgstr "고양이 사료 고마워! 냥이들 쓰다듬어 줘! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThe cats consider killing you, but don't this time. "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t고양이들이 너를 죽일까 고민하지만, 이번엔 참는다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "NICE!"
msgstr "좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is delighted by the makeshift cat food!\r\n"
"\tShe shows the group her special reserve of cats dressed in little clothes and the ones that are less likely to bite hard enough to draw blood."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 급조한 고양이 사료에 크게 기뻐한다!\r\n"
"\t옷 입은 특별 고양이들과, 피가 날 만큼 세게 물 가능성이 적은 고양이들을 일행에게 보여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Much like the cats she loves, "
msgstr "자기가 사랑하는 고양이들처럼, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" now sees you as a source of food that she can then give directly to her "
"cats. She starts following you around."
msgstr "은(는) 이제 너희를 고양이들에게 바로 줄 수 있는 식량 공급원으로 본다. 너희를 따라다니기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" insists that you get rid of someone that's scaring her precious cats! She "
"points at:"
msgstr "은(는) 소중한 고양이들을 겁주는 사람을 내보내라고 고집한다! 그녀가 가리킨 사람:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "The Last Cat Lady"
msgstr "최후의 고양이 아줌마"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "When entering the trading camp, "
msgstr "거래 캠프에 들어서자, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " detected an "
msgstr "은(는) 감지했다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "overpowering stench"
msgstr "압도적인 악취"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
", different from the usual smell of death. The source is all these cats.\r\n"
"\tA woman is among the cats, and she asks right away if "
msgstr ""
", 평소의 죽음 냄새와는 다른. 근원은 이 고양이들이다.\r\n"
"\t고양이들 사이에 한 여자가 있는데, 곧바로 묻는다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" has any spare cat food. \r\n"
"\tShe will join you for 20 food!"
msgstr ""
"에게 남는 고양이 사료가 있냐고. \r\n"
"\t식량 20을 주면 합류하겠단다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Give her 5 food"
msgstr "식량 5를 준다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:114
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Give her 10 food"
msgstr "식량 10을 준다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Give her 20 food!"
msgstr "식량 20을 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:125
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" notices that the team is already full.\r\n"
"\t\tYou'll have to boot someone out of the team to make room for her."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 팀이 이미 꽉 찼다는 걸 알아챈다.\r\n"
"\t\t그녀의 자리를 만들려면 누군가를 내보내야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" joins the team! She says she'd rather be heading towards Colombia, but at "
"least Canada also starts with a "
msgstr "이(가) 팀에 합류한다! 콜롬비아로 가고 싶었다지만, 적어도 캐나다도 같은 글자로 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "'C'."
msgstr "'C'."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Zombie Harvest"
msgstr "좀비 수확"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" meets a sturdy woman wearing old fashioned clothes. She is wielding an especially heavy cast iron frying pan.\r\n"
"\tShe says that she was visiting this country, but got stuck here after the zombies happened. She offers to join the team in exchange for 10 food, up front."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 옛날식 옷을 입은 다부진 여자를 만난다. 유난히 무거운 무쇠 프라이팬을 들고 있다.\r\n"
"\t이 나라에 여행 왔다가 좀비 사태 이후 발이 묶였다고 한다. 선불로 식량 10을 주면 팀에 합류하겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:138
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:396
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:506
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:529
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave her for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:141
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Her price is 10 food, and you don't have enough."
msgstr "그녀의 몸값은 식량 10인데, 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " starts following! It "
msgstr "이(가) 따라오기 시작한다! 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "IMMEDIATELY"
msgstr "즉시"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " crams its horns into "
msgstr " 뿔을 들이박는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Did you know that goats produce the most milk out of any livestock animal? Roughly 300 times more than a cow!\r\n"
"\t\tAlso the goat gores "
msgstr ""
"염소가 모든 가축 중에 젖을 가장 많이 낸다는 거 알아? 소보다 약 300배나 많아!\r\n"
"\t\t그리고 염소가 들이받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:176
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " pretty bad."
msgstr "을(를) 꽤 세게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" attempts to milk the goat again.\r\n"
"\t\tOnce again, the goat gores "
msgstr ""
"이(가) 다시 염소젖을 짜려 한다.\r\n"
"\t\t또다시 염소가 들이받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " manages to get some milk from the goat!"
msgstr "은(는) 염소젖을 조금 짜낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " gets some milk from the goat before dying. Nice!"
msgstr "은(는) 죽기 전에 염소젖을 조금 짜낸다. 굿!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You can't get goat milk from a male goat!"
msgstr "수컷 염소에게서는 젖을 짤 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "The goat gores "
msgstr "염소가 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " extra hard, so "
msgstr "을(를) 유난히 세게 들이받아서, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " remembers this lesson."
msgstr "는 이 교훈을 기억한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " didn't manage to remember this lesson from last time."
msgstr "은(는) 지난번 교훈을 기억하지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "The goat is disappointed that "
msgstr "염소는 실망한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " died already, as he wanted to thunk "
msgstr "이(가) 벌써 죽어 버렸기 때문이다. 염소는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " twice."
msgstr "를 두 번 들이받고 싶었다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Who should milk the goat? "
msgstr "누가 염소젖을 짤까? "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:209
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " seems "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:209
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "ornery."
msgstr "까칠해 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Changed my mind!"
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Who should recruit the goat? "
msgstr "누가 염소를 영입할까? "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Year of the Goat"
msgstr "염소의 해"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "It's a goat! "
msgstr "염소다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"'s just chilling near the camp. Doing goat things. No one seems to own "
msgstr "는 캠프 근처에서 빈둥거리며 염소 짓을 하고 있다. 아무도 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "... the goat is just here."
msgstr "의 주인은 아닌 것 같다... 그냥 여기 있는 염소다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Milk the goat!"
msgstr "염소젖을 짠다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "The goat is staring at "
msgstr "염소가 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " with intensity. "
msgstr "을(를) 뚫어지게 노려본다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "'s up to something."
msgstr "는 뭔가 꾸미고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit the goat!"
msgstr "염소를 영입한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"The goat is startled by your full group! If only you had a smaller team..."
msgstr "염소는 꽉 찬 일행에 깜짝 놀란다! 팀이 좀 더 작았더라면..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You say that you also love sports. The "
msgstr "너도 스포츠를 좋아한다고 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:239
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Ultimate Sports Fan"
msgstr "궁극의 스포츠 팬"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " bonds with you instantly due to shared interests."
msgstr "은(는) 공통 관심사 덕에 금세 너와 친해진다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" notices that the team is already full. You'll have to boot someone out to "
"make room for more sports."
msgstr "은(는) 팀이 이미 꽉 찼다는 걸 알아챈다. 더 많은 스포츠를 위해 누군가를 내보내야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "ULTIMATE SPORTS"
msgstr "궁극의 스포츠"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " meets the "
msgstr "은(는) 만난다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is holding a limited edition air horn and it looks like "
msgstr "는 한정판 에어혼을 들고 있는데, 아무래도 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is about to "
msgstr "는 지금 막 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "BLAST IT!"
msgstr "불어 젖힐 기세다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "I love sports. Even in the post-zombocalypse."
msgstr "난 스포츠가 좋아. 좀비 종말 이후에도."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:251
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:483
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:765
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:785
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:800
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1038
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:251
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:483
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:765
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:785
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:800
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1038
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit Sports"
msgstr "스포츠를 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " needs more skeleton room! You have to get rid of someone:"
msgstr "은(는) 해골 공간이 더 필요하다! 누군가를 내보내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " waves her hand at "
msgstr "이(가) 손을 흔든다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" cumbersome flesh falls off, revealing a wonderful skeleton underneath."
msgstr " 거추장스러운 살점이 떨어져 나가고, 그 아래 멋진 해골이 드러난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Much better! Big improvement! Well, let's go."
msgstr "훨씬 낫네! 엄청 좋아졌어! 자, 가자."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" looks a little disappointed. Maybe it's because she would have preferred to"
" turn someone into a skeleton."
msgstr "은(는) 조금 실망한 눈치다. 아마 누군가를 해골로 만드는 쪽이 더 좋았나 보다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Skeletons vs Zombies"
msgstr "해골 대 좀비"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "This woman offers to join "
msgstr "이 여자는 합류하겠다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ", along with her "
msgstr "에, 자기 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "ARMY OF SKELETONS!"
msgstr "해골 군대와 함께!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "She asks for either 10 food, or that she gets to turn "
msgstr "대가로 식량 10을 달라거나, 아니면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " into a skeletal minion."
msgstr "을(를) 해골 하수인으로 만들게 해 달라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave her alone"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit her for 10 food!"
msgstr "식량 10에 영입한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Let her skeletonize "
msgstr "해골로 만들게 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" buys the Ded9! \r\n"
"\tBig revolver power, little pistol speed.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) Ded9을 산다! \r\n"
"\t리볼버의 위력, 권총의 속도.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "This gun has never let me down! It won't betray you!"
msgstr "이 총은 날 실망시킨 적이 없어! 너를 배신하지 않을 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "I'll protect you on the way to Canada! I promise I won't betray you."
msgstr "캐나다까지 가는 길에 지켜 줄게! 절대 배신하지 않겠다고 약속하지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " He's said that at least twice now, so he must really mean it."
msgstr " 이 말을 벌써 두 번은 했으니, 진심인 게 분명하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" needs extra room for his unnecessarily large pistol. Who leaves the group?"
msgstr "은(는) 쓸데없이 큰 권총 때문에 자리가 더 필요하다. 누가 일행을 떠날까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "No Idea on the Acronym"
msgstr "약자는 뭔지 모름"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This guy looks ominous.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 남자는 불길해 보인다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"I'm a special agent on a special mission. It's a zombie warzone out there. I"
" promise I won't betray you."
msgstr "난 특수 임무를 맡은 특수 요원이다. 밖은 좀비 전쟁터지. 절대 배신하지 않겠다고 약속하지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "This all sounds good. He offers to sell "
msgstr "좋은 이야기다. 그는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:320
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " a powerful pistol for 10 food, or join "
msgstr "에게 강력한 권총을 식량 10에 팔거나, 식량 20을 받고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:320
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " for 20 food."
msgstr "에 합류하겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" already bought the Ded9, so he's reduced the price of recruiting him to 10 "
"food."
msgstr "은(는) 이미 Ded9을 샀으니, 그는 영입 비용을 식량 10으로 낮춰 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy Ded9 Pistol - 10 food"
msgstr "Ded9 권총 구매 - 식량 10"
